  <center><h2>WElCOME</h2></center>
  <center><table>
  <tr>
	<td>Welcome to Spice Garden, where timeless family recipes meet the vibrant warmth of freshly ground spices. Every dish is prepared daily using hand-selected ingredients and authentic culinary traditions, bringing you rich aromas, unforgettable flavors, and heartfelt hospitality in every bite. Whether you are gathering with loved ones for a celebratory feast or craving a comforting meal crafted with passion, we invite you to relax, savor the moment, and experience the true essence of fine dining with us.</td>
